      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, the courser gains a +10-foot enhancement bonus to their land speed. This bonus increases by 10 feet at 6th level, and every 4 courser levels thereafter. The courser loses these benefits when they wear medium or heavy armor, or is carrying a heavy load.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/courser#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
